  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1642/855/mp_darkrpg_fabric_header-webp.webp\" alt=\"DarkRPG Fabric版\"></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1642/861/mp_darkrpg_fabric_description-webp.webp\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<p>DarkRPG 是一款Minecraft RPG模組包，將Minecraft轉變為完整的奇幻RPG MMO，擁有1800多個任務、魔法、起源、技能、頭目和多人混戰。</p>\n<p>（您的原始生存體驗將因以下功能而永遠改變）</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">效能優化</span></strong> - 專為效能和低階設備打造！（與其他大型模組包相比）</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">多人遊戲</span></strong> - 專為伺服器打造！可自行架設伺服器。使用多人遊戲區塊中的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BisectHosting</a>連結，或點擊上方/下方的連結立即建立您的伺服器！</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">內建MMO官方伺服器</span></strong> - 與其他玩家和朋友在線上遊玩！只需下載模組包，點擊多人遊戲即可加入伺服器！</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">終極角色扮演體驗</span></strong> - 選擇您的面向 → 起源 → 類型 → 神聖面向 → 職業。自由搭配創造獨特可能性！</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">任務系統</span></strong> - 1800多個任務。按 [I] 鍵查看任務目標和遊戲內指南，按 [L] 鍵查看進度型任務</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">完整貨幣系統</span></strong> - 與其他玩家交易</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">賭場</span></strong> - 使用鑽石貨幣贏取稀有物品。立即遊玩苦力怕賭場和經驗賭場，贏取大獎！</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">拍賣行與商店</span></strong> - 向其他玩家出售您的商品</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">組隊系統</span></strong> - 建立隊伍並使用隊伍聊天與朋友交流</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">合成配方</span></strong> - 超過100種原版沒有的自訂合成配方</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">飛行與陸地坐騎</span></strong> - 可搭載多名乘客的自訂飛行物品，非常適合多人遊戲！</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">額外武器與護甲</span></strong> - 時尚展示您的裝備！</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">魔法系統</span></strong> - 魔杖、法術、特殊附魔與附魔台</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">技能系統</span></strong> - 提升魔法、戰鬥、挖掘技能，專精於不同學派</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">模組設定選單</span></strong> - 依喜好設定模組</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">小地圖與世界地圖</span></strong> - 為您的隊伍建立路標</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">世界領地系統</span></strong> - 保護您的物品免受其他玩家破壞</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">傳送石碑</span></strong> - 傳送至基地和朋友身邊</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">特殊頭目</span></strong> - 擊敗新的邪惡怪物並獲得戰利品</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">額外生態域</span></strong> - 探索令人興奮的美麗區域</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">額外方塊與物品</span></strong> - 盡情建造！</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">字型、準心和光影支援</span></strong> - 模組包內含字型、光影和準心</li>\n</ul>\n<p>DarkRPG 已預裝在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BisectHosting</a>！一鍵即可開始線上遊玩。<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BisectHosting</a>是領先的Minecraft伺服器解決方案。<strong>立即與朋友一起遊玩DarkRPG！</strong><br><strong>點擊下方橫幅</strong>或點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>，使用代碼 'gamerpotion' 即可享75折優惠！<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1642/858/mp_darkrpg_fabric_promob-webp.webp\" alt=\"立即取得伺服器！\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1644/220/mp_darkrpg_fabric_faq-webp.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"236\"></span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>此模組包包含許多生活品質模組。超過400個模組讓您享受數小時的樂趣！如有任何問題，請加入我們的Discord（下方連結）</li>\n<li>建議使用 <a href=\"https://download.curseforge.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge App</a> 並分配至少6-8GB的RAM來遊玩DarkRPG</li>\n<li>正在尋找Forge版本？請查看 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG Forge模組包</a></li>\n<li>正在尋找Redux 1.18.2版本？請查看 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg-redux\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG REDUX模組包</a></li>\n<li><strong>請將您的Java更新至至少17.0.11，以避免與頭目戰鬥時出現粒子崩潰。更多資訊請前往<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.gamerpotion.net%252f2024%252f12%252fhow-to-resolve-packet-overload.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</strong></li>\n<li>加入伺服器時遇到起源ID錯誤？先建立一個單人世界，選擇起源和職業直到完全載入，然後登出並重新加入伺服器</li>\n<li>正在尋找任務？按<strong>L</strong>鍵開啟進度選單，點擊書本圖示查看DarkQuesting進度型任務。按<strong>I</strong>鍵開啟FTB任務選單，將滑鼠移至左側即可查看不同任務類別。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1644/221/mp_darkrpg_fabric_youtube-webp.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"236\"></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oMjs0Xpf6PU\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vHM1u9TVOBY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/n6sw2Vtfb7E?wmode=transparent\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NKYG7phGaPA?wmode=transparent\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zTILoyrgNPU\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BdVHfrNjiI0?wmode=transparent\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vAVMS_1tTro?wmode=transparent\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Jnt9g0dfD2E?wmode=transparent\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5sL5Pls2MBo?wmode=transparent\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZQqrsZF2gRY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ust0Iqv8t3k?wmode=transparent\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1644/222/mp_darkrpg_fabric_discord-webp.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"235\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1644/223/mp_darkrpg_fabric_kofi-webp.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"235\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">